color-management-v1: add wlr_color_manager_v1_destroy()

Lets the compositor drop the color manager at runtime, e.g. when it
switches to a renderer without color transforms. The global is removed;
objects clients already made keep working until they are destroyed.
Image description identities stay unique across managers.

